{"id":"5510","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5510_main_single-cell-cumulonimbus-capillatus-praecipitatio-over-exeter-devon_clouds-hydrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>该积雨云最近刚从秃状云转变为鬃状云，这从云的上层一些部分<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">略显纤维状纹理</span>可见一斑，不过它总体仍然保持着积云状结构。</p>\n<p>在云底下面可见最新形成的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">降水柱</span>，由雨和可能还有小冰雹组成。这在云的南侧（右侧）受太阳照射的地方特别明显。</p>\n<p>在图<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">右上侧</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">左下侧</span>附近可看到较早的鬃积雨云的卷云状云砧。在图片左下侧附近，在其中一个较早的积雨云下方可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">雨幡</span>。图中还出现更适度垂直发展的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积云</span>。</p>\n<p>这些积雨云形成于以北海为中心的低压西南侧不稳定极地海洋气流内。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Matthew Clark","location":"英国，德文郡EX2 9UD，埃克塞特，邓奇迪克","latitude":"纬度: 50° 41' 28'' N","longitude":"经度: 3° 35' 28'' W","date":"10 April 2012 1310 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.10.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.10.3"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5510_syn_single-cell-cumulonimbus-capillatus-praecipitatio-over-exeter-devon_clouds-hydrometeors.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>2012年4月10日1200 UTC的地面分析图显示出低压槽东移越过该地区。影响英国是不稳定的西偏西北极地海洋气团，位于以北海为中心的低压西南侧。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5510_upper_single-cell-cumulonimbus-capillatus-praecipitatio-over-exeter-devon_clouds-hydrometeors.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>这是2012年4月10日1200 UTC在英国英格兰坎伯恩的无线电探空仪数据。有较小对流不稳定性，条件不稳定廓线大约距地6000米。不稳定层的表征是中等西风气流（大约25–30 kt）和极弱的垂直风切变。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/radar/5510_radar_single-cell-cumulonimbus-capillatus-praecipitatio-over-exeter-devon_clouds-hydrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>2012年4月10日1300-1415 UTC的连续雷达降雨率图像显示出与所拍摄的积雨云有关的降水的发展（各图中的箭头）。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5510_sat_single-cell-cumulonimbus-capillatus-praecipitatio-over-exeter-devon_clouds-hydrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>EUMETSAT红外图像显示出在英国英格兰西南上空有新的积状云开始发展。1500 UTC图像显示出英格兰南部和中部上空的小积雨云单体。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2012","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4752_main_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus-praecipitatio_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>该图显示了积雨云上升云塔的大型垂直范围。顶部被傍晚的太阳照亮，左侧呈现明亮的白色，而云的其余部分则更暗。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">右上方的云是纤维状的</span>，表明是鬃状云云种，右侧有一个砧状切变 - 这是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">砧状附加特征</span>。云的顶部（从这个角度看）<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">正在失去锐度</span>，因为这个细胞从浓积云转变为积雨云。在云层之下，太阳照亮了一个<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">强大的降水轴</span> - 降水性补充特征。几乎围绕强大对流云的深灰色云层是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层积云</span>，而左上方的白色纤维云是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">毛卷云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Frann Brothers","location":"美国德克萨斯州得林瓜","latitude":"纬度: 29° 19' 18'' N","longitude":"经度: 103° 36' 58'' W","date":"21 August 2014 1800 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: P.10.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.10.3"}]}]}